### Crear cuentas
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Ana", "currency": "MXN" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Luis", "currency": "MXN" }

### Depositar 500 a la cuenta 1
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/1/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 500.00 }

### Transferir 200 de la cuenta 1 a la 2
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountId": 2, "amount": 200.00 }

### Consultar saldos
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/2

### Error esperado: saldo insuficiente (422)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountId": 2, "amount": 999999 }

### Error esperado: validación (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "amount": -5 }

### ---------------- Transferencia idempotente ----------------

### Primera vez: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountId": 2, "amount": 50.00 }

### Repetir EXACTAMENTE lo mismo: 200 OK + cabecera Idempotent-Replayed: true (el dinero no se mueve otra vez)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountId": 2, "amount": 50.00 }

### Misma clave con otro monto: 422 Idempotency key conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{ "fromAccountId": 1, "toAccountId": 2, "amount": 75.00 }

### ---------------- Historial paginado ----------------

### Más recientes primero; page empieza en 0; size entre 1 y 100
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/1/transactions?page=0&size=5

### Documentación interactiva: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
### Salud: http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
